# emoji.ar — gemoji-style :shortcode: → emoji auto-replace pairs.
# Load ON TOP of your own auto-replace map with:  ADDAR emoji.ar
# Then type e.g. :smile: and trigger AR (e.g. Shift+Space if bound 57=AR;" ").
# Shortcodes follow the GitHub gemoji standard (github/gemoji) (with additions).
# UTF-8 documents only.

